<h2>On your server</h2>
<p>To see what changed since your last update:</p>
<pre><code>git fetch
git log --oneline HEAD..origin/main</code></pre>
<p>
  We don't keep a hand-written list here, because it would only drift from the log. Every entry in the real one
  was written by the person who made the change.
</p>
